4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nZZeNhtMHU8Q7kNvwEtn5Vb&_nc_oc=AdoXH08kUsBO2tZHPBjOM0O-IHrN94omVH4XSKPNT_Eya5RCuQzTIH7lzWbqjBG7eKo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af24nooVmtoQlj0xApU3g9nl5A01pYLZ7wZuylHg479lbQ&oe=69D3AF54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dtGJ9mKcpXMQ7kNvwEe01yO&_nc_oc=AdpAkY-DEyPGnk3YsiqHwHZBy8XqxymXSa1zT6MWsFHid8N3GsUebnPx4wA0j572uYU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3L-rHn-SUZOVgCQH3UjvvQet25EYZcbR-zHDDSgBtI6w&oe=69D3B432"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SOSCSNLQbnoQ7kNvwGFP46i&_nc_oc=AdpF4zhL9KMbBFwmPyrIV3qmTqC0X7N_jZHbO9pmQsCooNIOBboOAf-20u3FMz8_lnk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2XwnznRxwnxRyCFrms2ByI7vtskqiZHorxWOXTwN2AXA&oe=69D3C1D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p